{
 "_doc": "What stands behind and in front of the play plane: view only, nothing in core reads this. biomes: per surface biome, sky (sky_top, sky_low: multipliers on the time of day's colours), haze (the colour distance fades to, a multiplier on the horizon colour), light (a multiplier on the sky's light on everything), mist (0..1, how far up a backdrop the haze climbs), layers (colours and shapes by layer name), props (near silhouettes) and fore (foreground). layers: back to front; depth: tiles behind the play plane, so real perspective makes the parallax; k: how much of the real ground height a layer follows (see view/backdrops.gd); step: tiles between ribbon columns; haze: how much distance has already faded it; fade: tiles down from its top over which the biome's mist takes it; smooth: half-width in tiles of the ground's smoothing. A shape: amp (tiles of rolling hills), ridge (tiles of sharp ridges), scale (tiles a feature spans), teeth (tiles of a treeline's points), every (tiles between points), mesa (0..1, flattens tops into tables). models: props by name, fit_h tiles tall. near: how the near props are laid. fore: the foreground (z tiles in front of the play plane). blend_tiles: how far a biome's sky and backdrops blend across a seam, each way.",
 "below": {"_doc": "The underground's atmosphere (view/below_look.gd, view/shaders/deep_fog.gdshader): view only. z_tiles: the fog sheet's plane (walls are at -0.5, actors at 0). regions: per region biome, fog (colour), density (0-1), ambient (how much fog shows with no light on it; 0 keeps the dark black), motes [drift x, drift y (tiles a second), share of cells, twinkle], water (deep_lake: the colour of the light the water gives). rock, rock_glow: the faint glow rock and walls take near the region's light, so a lit cavern sits in tinted shadow, not a black void (gs_below_rock, terrain.gdshader gs_deep_glow); the colour times the glow multiplies the albedo. None in the underdark, whose dark stays black.", "z_tiles": -0.44, "regions": {"underdark": {"fog": "#3c4150", "density": 0.2, "ambient": 0.0, "motes": [0, 0, 0, 0]}, "fungal": {"fog": "#8466dc", "density": 0.62, "ambient": 0.05, "motes": [0.03, -0.16, 0.1, 0.6], "rock": "#7a5cc8", "rock_glow": 0.1}, "crystal": {"fog": "#6c9ce8", "density": 0.4, "ambient": 0.03, "motes": [0.02, 0.02, 0.12, 1.0], "rock": "#6f8fd8", "rock_glow": 0.09}, "deep_lake": {"fog": "#3a9e90", "density": 0.75, "ambient": 0.06, "motes": [0.05, 0.02, 0.08, 0.7], "water": "#1fa08e", "rock": "#3a9e90", "rock_glow": 0.09}, "magma": {"fog": "#d84a14", "density": 0.7, "ambient": 0.09, "motes": [0.04, 0.5, 0.14, 0.8], "rock": "#d0582a", "rock_glow": 0.32}}},
